62","id":5240570912,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOFzEIA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-10T12:55:34Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T12:55:34Z","body":"I don't see how this is a bug, it's not possible to set this value in the editor to this error value correct? If it requires hacking the configuration I don't see how this is a bug","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5240570912/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5240585356","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122262#issuecomment-5240585356","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122262","id":5240585356,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOFz8jA","user":{"login":"scott-blueraven","id":154465522,"node_id":"U_kgDOCTT08g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154465522?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scott-blueraven","html_url":"https://github.com/scott-blueraven","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scott-blueraven/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scott-blueraven/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scott-blueraven/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scott-blueraven/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scott-blueraven/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scott-blueraven/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scott-blueraven/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scott-blueraven/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scott-blueraven/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-10T12:56:41Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T12:56:41Z","body":"Transparency, gladly: yes — this report was drafted by an AI assistant (Claude) working under my direction, from a debugging session we did together; I reviewed it before filing. The investigation itself was verified by hand on real hardware: the empty `TARGETED_DEVICE_FAMILY` in the generated pbxproj, the missing `UIDeviceFamily` in the built ipa, and the on-device compatibility-window behavior were each confirmed directly, including a three-app control experiment (identical minimal apps differing only in `UIDeviceFamily`). Apologies for mangling the template on filing — noted for next time.\n\nOn \"not a bug\" — fair challenge, and you're right that the editor's dropdown can't produce the value. In practice `export_presets.cfg` does get edited outside the editor, though: scripts and CI, version-control merges, and hands following Godot 3.x-era advice (where `3` was the bitmask meaning iPhone+iPad — which is exactly how it landed in our preset). Any out-of-range value currently exports *successfully* while silently emitting the empty declaration, and the resulting failure on device gives no hint it originated in the preset — that silence is what cost us days.\n\nIf \"bug\" is the wrong label, no argument — would export-time validation (an error, or clamping with a warning) be acceptable as an enhancement instead? Happy for this to be relabeled or closed per your triage either way.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5240585356/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5240605364","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122262#issuecomment-5240605364","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122262","id":5240605364,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOF1KtA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","si